# It is NOT caused by the platform-adapter change in this PR; the other 15
# regressions MATCH, including all label/create/write-channel tests.
# Full grep confirms test-platform-open-parity.py is referenced by NO gate, so
# it does not block pr-create/pr-merge. Repairing the missing GitHub copy needs
